# GPT Realtime Whisper — findings by Qwen 3.8 27B

- Source: OpenAI (`gpt-realtime-whisper`)
- Date: 2026-09-29 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** GPT Realtime Whisper (`gpt-realtime-whisper`)
- **Short description:** OpenAI's streaming speech-to-text model for realtime transcription; returns low-latency transcript deltas from live audio and a final transcript per committed audio turn, priced by audio duration rather than tokens. It is a specialized transcription variant of the GPT Realtime API family, not a speech-to-speech voice assistant.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI API, model ID `gpt-realtime-whisper`, exclusive to the Realtime transcription endpoint `v1/realtime/transcription_sessions` (WebSocket/WebRTC); all other endpoints (Chat Completions, Responses, Live, Batch, etc.) are "Not supported" per the OpenAI model page.
- **Release / knowledge:** No release date published on the fetched OpenAI docs pages; knowledge cutoff Sep 30, 2024 (OpenAI model page).
- **IDs:** `openai/gpt-realtime-whisper` (repo meta lists Zen ID `opencode/gpt-realtime-whisper`; no Zen page fetched this session).
- **Context window:** 16,000 tokens total, 2,000 max output tokens (OpenAI docs model page, fetched 2026-09-29; meta.json lists 128K — treated as unverified against docs). Realtime sessions are capped at 60 minutes duration (OpenAI Realtime conversations guide).
- **Modalities:** audio + text in; text out; no audio out; no image input; tool calls: not documented for this model (docs list only "streaming" as a supported feature); JSON mode: not documented.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-29):** $0.017 per minute of audio (OpenAI model page and pricing page "Transcription models" table: gpt-realtime-whisper, live transcription, $0.017/minute); no per-token rates and no free tier listed.
- **Architecture:** proprietary; base model not disclosed; naming suggests a Whisper-family speech-to-text backend behind the GPT Realtime API.

